JP Nichols Construction is a family-owned company built on integrity, craftsmanship, and long-lasting relationships. With over 30 years of experience in custom home building, pools, and renovations, we take pride in delivering exceptional quality and personalized service. Our expertise spans residential and commercial projects across Georgia and Florida, ensuring that every home, pool, or addition reflects our clients’ unique vision.

As an RV Park developer I take great pride in my ability to conceive and build a beautiful and profitable RV Resort on the Florida Panhandle coast in Walton county.  I can apply my skills to helping a customer create their vision in a new RV Park.  I know how it's done...start to finish.

